  "body": "Release created at  Sat Nov 14 17:02:01 CST 2026\nSynchronize Alpha branch code updates, keeping only the latest version\n<br>\n[\u6211\u5e94\u8be5\u4e0b\u8f7d\u54ea\u4e2a\u6587\u4ef6? / Which file should I download?](https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/wiki/FAQ)\n[\u4e8c\u8fdb\u5236\u6587\u4ef6\u7b5b\u9009 / Binary file selector](https://metacubex.github.io/Meta-Docs/startup/#_1)\n[\u67e5\u770b\u6587\u6863 / Docs](https://metacubex.github.io/Meta-Docs/)\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix: use correct format verb for subscription-userinfo parse errors by @AaronChen0 in https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/pull/3455\n* feat(snell): support optional userkey for Snell v6 outbound by @CatMsg in https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/pull/3460\n\n## New Contributors\n* @CatMsg made their first contribution in https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/pull/3460\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/compare/v1.19.34...Prerelease-Alpha",
